1
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,160
Master.

2
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,770
You wanted to see me?

3
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,240
You used human lives to set the trap.

4
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,520
You're a fast learner.

5
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,240
Thanks to you,

6
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,520
Zhang Yinhua, every three to five years,

7
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,980
comes to perform a ritual.

8
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:43,880
It can bring a lot of gold to the sect.

9
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:46,790
I taught you to hunt wild Paozi,

10
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:49,200
not the souls of young ladies.

11
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:51,480
Is the killing really that important?

12
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:52,750
Didn't you ask me

13
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:53,920
to kill Li Yingjuan?

14
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:57,560
I killed her to save thousands of lives
in the sect.

15
00:00:57,810 --> 00:00:59,170
Now you kill people

16
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:02,480
to feed your greed.

17
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:05,480
You're exaggerating.

18
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,920
I'm just following your teachings.

19
00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:10,800
After all, I'm not the only one
who needs to be fed.

20
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,400
Didn't you teach me this?

21
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:15,120
Sometimes dead people are more useful
than the living.

22
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,920
The century-old foundation
of Tianxiang Sect

23
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:21,680
isn't built on killing,

24
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,870
but on rules that terrify the wicked

25
00:01:24,310 --> 00:01:26,789
and are respected by the good.

26
00:01:26,789 --> 00:01:28,120
Rules?

27
00:01:30,289 --> 00:01:32,740
Ask the brothers out there
who have taken a bullet.

28
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:35,380
Do they like the loyalty
Second Master speak of

29
00:01:35,890 --> 00:01:38,090
or the clinking of silver dollars?

30
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:40,990
The brothers in the sect are wild horses.

31
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,789
You're the one holding the reins!

32
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,840
You have to teach them
benevolence, righteousness, and ethics.

33
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,560
You can't let them tread further into danger.

34
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,680
That's what you should do!

35
00:01:51,870 --> 00:01:53,350
In times of peace,

36
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:55,100
we might not need to kill.

37
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:57,950
But look at the world out there now.

38
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:00,280
We can't fool those in high power.

39
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,200
Those with guns

40
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,870
can take our lives at any time.

41
00:02:03,070 --> 00:02:05,120
What do you expect us to live on?

42
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:09,080
We can only rely on people
like Zhang Yinhua.

43
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,310
Do you know

44
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,870
why Tianxiang Sect exists?

45
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:23,280
To uphold justice?

46
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:26,110
It was to overthrow the Qing and restore the Ming.

47
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:27,760
But

48
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:30,350
the Qing Dynasty has fallen.

49
00:02:35,070 --> 00:02:36,600
The Tianxiang Sect

50
00:02:39,829 --> 00:02:42,040
should no longer exist either.

51
00:02:45,110 --> 00:02:47,040
We should have disbanded long ago.

52
00:02:47,210 --> 00:02:48,980
We've been with you for so long

53
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:50,910
and done so much for you.

54
00:02:51,370 --> 00:02:53,530
And you're just going to disband us
just like that?

55
00:02:53,530 --> 00:02:55,770
What do you want to do, then?

56
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:58,980
That'll depend on whether the brothers accept it.

57
00:03:42,350 --> 00:03:43,390
Master.

58
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:48,470
It's time to make room
for the new world.

59
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,400
All right.

60
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:53,960
I'll

61
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,680
do a final reading

62
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,000
for you today.

63
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:02,820
Kan and Li are in opposition,

64
00:04:03,550 --> 00:04:05,550
an ominous star offends the Dipper.

65
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,150
Today,

66
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:10,200
the brothers who risk their lives for you

67
00:04:10,710 --> 00:04:11,520
will one day be

68
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:14,430
the evil spirits that take your life.

69
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:15,840
Second,

70
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,829
in your life,

71
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,970
the Solitary Phoenix star stirs.

72
00:04:19,970 --> 00:04:21,000
Your lover

73
00:04:21,339 --> 00:04:24,600
will eventually become
the arrow that pierces your heart.

74
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,860
You will never enjoy the bliss of family.

75
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,920
Third,

76
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:31,200
you can't hide your thoughts.

77
00:04:33,470 --> 00:04:34,190
It's time to go.

78
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:35,510
You never know

79
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:38,120
when to pull in the net.

80
00:04:57,460 --> 00:05:00,120
-Welcome, Sect Master!
-Welcome, Sect Master!

81
00:06:44,470 --> 00:06:48,480
[A Prophet]

82
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:51,380
[Episode 24]

83
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,600
It's time.

84
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:55,390
Execute!

85
00:07:21,190 --> 00:07:31,480
-Kill!
-Kill!

86
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,120
Fourth Brother,

87
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,270
please do me one last favor.

88
00:07:54,159 --> 00:07:55,159
Find Silly Liang.

89
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:57,070
He'll take you to Jialing Hotel.

90
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:57,560
Director Feng!

91
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,680
Go find Feng Siyuan.

92
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,600
Stop making a scene.

93
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,160
Director Feng!

94
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:00,800
Tell him

95
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,950
the strong wind is about to rise.

96
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:03,800
Director Feng!

97
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,600
The strong wind is about to rise.

98
00:08:14,970 --> 00:08:17,770
I didn't expect you to grace us with your presence.

99
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,860
Are you Director Wang?

100
00:08:25,390 --> 00:08:26,520
Who the hell are you?

101
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:29,750
Take him down.

102
00:08:29,750 --> 00:08:30,430
Wait.

103
00:08:32,789 --> 00:08:35,049
Is there some kind of misunderstanding?

104
00:08:36,549 --> 00:08:39,200
This is why I say Sect Master is my lucky star.

105
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:41,100
You asked me to go east,

106
00:08:41,100 --> 00:08:42,230
but I went west.

107
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,730
I just took the seat as Deputy Director
of the Field Headquarters.

108
00:08:45,730 --> 00:08:47,230
Then I must congratulate you.

109
00:08:47,230 --> 00:08:48,900
Right in your territory,

110
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:52,340
we caught a wanted criminal.

111
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:54,630
Director Feng,

112
00:08:55,150 --> 00:08:56,480
welcome.

113
00:08:56,670 --> 00:08:59,130
Forgive me for not coming out to welcome you.

114
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,440
It's confirmed that

115
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:04,480
Wang Zhicheng,
Chief of Yucheng Police Station,

116
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,910
has committed 3 felonies.

117
00:09:05,910 --> 00:09:06,720
The evidence is conclusive.

118
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,600
He is to be lawfully arrested,

119
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,670
by the Yucheng Field Headquarters.

120
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:09,960
Approved by Director Feng.

121
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,820
Director Feng.

122
00:09:10,830 --> 00:09:12,790
We both serve the Party and the State.

123
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:14,200
You can't just listen to others' instigations!

124
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,000
Take him away!

125
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,220
Director Feng.

126
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:18,390
Director Feng!

127
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:20,030
Please let me explain, Director Feng.

128
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:20,760
Sect Master!

129
00:09:21,290 --> 00:09:23,220
Sect Master, save me! Sect Master!

130
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:24,270
Sect Master!

131
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,320
The third wife of Wang Zhicheng

132
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,480
is my man.

133
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:30,110
She has already

134
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,200
recorded down everything

135
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:34,080
about Wang Zhicheng bribery.

136
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:36,840
These are the details
and photos of his bribery.

137
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:39,840
Giving Wang Zhicheng's
political achievements to Feng Siyuan

138
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,170
is just our first move.

139
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:43,200
He just arrived in Yucheng

140
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,030
and is anxious to gain a foothold.

141
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:46,790
The one he wants
to curry favor with the most right now

142
00:09:46,790 --> 00:09:48,030
must be Chairman Liu.

143
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,470
Chairman Liu was a military man
in his early years.

144
00:09:51,470 --> 00:09:53,150
He pacified the various warlords.

145
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:55,270
Once the territory he conquered was stable,

146
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:57,330
he changed into the chairman's gown.

147
00:09:57,550 --> 00:09:58,200
Rice wine,

148
00:09:58,390 --> 00:09:59,030
well salt,

149
00:09:59,240 --> 00:09:59,960
and opium—

150
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:02,320
all these lucrative trades
must go through the chairman's hands.

151
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,000
Even if God wants to rain,

152
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,550
he'd have to wire the provincial office

153
00:10:05,550 --> 00:10:07,010
to ask for his permission.

154
00:10:07,700 --> 00:10:09,500
Chairman Liu is high and mighty.

155
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:10,840
but only Sect Master...

156
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,240
knows what he's truly thinking.

157
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:16,510
Next,

158
00:10:16,530 --> 00:10:18,960
we're going to feed this ambitious Feng Siyuan

159
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,760
a completely fabricated story.

160
00:10:21,150 --> 00:10:22,080
From now on,

161
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:24,360
this book will be called the Yin Book.

162
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,960
We need to make Feng Siyuan believe

163
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,440
that this is Sect Master's secret weapon.

164
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,960
As long as he possesses the Yin Book,

165
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,200
Feng Siyuan will have

166
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:32,630
glory and wealth in Yucheng.

167
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:35,190
So now we need to lead Feng Siyuan by the nose

168
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,960
and make him seek out Sect Master on his own.

169
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,870
The calligraphy you and your mentor

170
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:41,530
got your hands on a few days ago

171
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,250
is the best stepping stone.

172
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,360
Director Feng.

173
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,750
This is

174
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,910
Master Zheng's calligraphy
that Chairman Liu has always wanted.

175
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:49,200
I heard that he's going to hold

176
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,200
a birthday banquet soon.

177
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,270
This gift

178
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,600
is perfect.

179
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,480
What a brilliant contrast of ink,

180
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:56,120
with slender branches and thick leaves.

181
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,480
For such a grand gift,

182
00:10:59,030 --> 00:11:00,490
I should thank Miss Jiang.

183
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:01,980
I'm just glad it helps.

184
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:08,360
But Chairman Liu never sees new officials.

185
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,770
No matter how good the gift is,

186
00:11:11,150 --> 00:11:12,870
it's useless if it can't be delivered.

187
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:14,730
There's someone who can help you.

188
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,160
Sect Master.

189
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,960
Are you kidding me?

190
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:23,000
The head of a bunch of swindlers—

191
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,510
what right does he have
to approach Chairman Liu?

192
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:26,320
The Yin Book.

193
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:27,910
The Yin Book?

194
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,760
During the Ming Dynasty,

195
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:32,430
the Imperial Guards
wrote the Yang Book for His Majesty.

196
00:11:32,430 --> 00:11:34,840
It recorded all the

197
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:36,440
shady deeds of the dynasty's officials.

198
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,810
Sect Master followed suit

199
00:11:37,810 --> 00:11:40,360
and spread spies
around the high officials and nobles.

200
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:42,020
and compiled his own Yin Book.

201
00:11:42,170 --> 00:11:43,750
The Sect Master used the Yin Book

202
00:11:43,750 --> 00:11:45,870
to help Chairman Liu clear the way

203
00:11:45,890 --> 00:11:47,010
and keep everyone in check.

204
00:11:47,010 --> 00:11:49,540
That's why Chairman Liu trusts him so deeply.

205
00:11:50,030 --> 00:11:51,290
Why should I trust you?

206
00:11:51,510 --> 00:11:52,480
Director Feng,

207
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,530
even if you don't trust him,

208
00:11:54,910 --> 00:11:56,150
you should trust me.

209
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,550
Sect Master put me next to you,

210
00:11:58,960 --> 00:11:59,720
yet I

211
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:02,360
never set a trap against you.

212
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:06,870
This is Wang Zhicheng's secret file
from the Yin Book.

213
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:08,400
Whether it's true or false,

214
00:12:08,590 --> 00:12:10,390
you'll know once you test it out.

215
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,000
If this Yin Book

216
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:19,240
is really as important as you both say,

217
00:12:19,730 --> 00:12:21,790
why don't you keep it for yourselves?

218
00:12:22,740 --> 00:12:24,270
Something like the Yin Book

219
00:12:24,510 --> 00:12:26,320
can only become a ladder to the sky

220
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:28,120
in the hands of the right person.

221
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:30,710
But in the hands of nobodies like us,

222
00:12:30,730 --> 00:12:32,660
it will only bring more trouble.

223
00:12:33,030 --> 00:12:34,390
I can't accept a reward without merit.

224
00:12:34,390 --> 00:12:36,320
You prepared such a big gift for me.

225
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,840
I'm curious—

226
00:12:37,910 --> 00:12:39,910
what do you want from me?

227
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:41,790
What I want

228
00:12:41,810 --> 00:12:45,010
is for you to help me
eradicate the entire Tianxiang Sect.

229
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:46,670
In this way,

230
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,790
you can replace him

231
00:12:49,100 --> 00:12:51,500
and become Chairman Liu's right-hand man.

232
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:57,050
If you run into trouble,

233
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,440
look for me here.

234
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:01,000
Jialing Hotel?

235
00:13:02,150 --> 00:13:03,950
The strong wind is about to rise.

236
00:13:04,270 --> 00:13:05,780
Now that official business is done,

237
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:07,540
I have a personal matter

238
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,560
to trouble Sect Master with.

239
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,620
You're too polite.

240
00:13:10,670 --> 00:13:11,600
Let's talk in private.

241
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,480
This way.

242
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,030
Please.

243
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:20,750
In public,

244
00:13:20,910 --> 00:13:22,170
Wang Zhicheng is down.

245
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,240
In private,

246
00:13:25,270 --> 00:13:26,000
should we

247
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,870
corporate more?

248
00:13:28,150 --> 00:13:29,750
Don't mention cooperation.

249
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:31,790
It's my honor

250
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:33,030
to be able to help you.

251
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,550
There is no time like the present.

252
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:35,840
I happen to have a small matter right now

253
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,360
that I need Sect Master's help with.

254
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,030
Go ahead.

255
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:40,870
I prepared a birthday gift
for Chairman Liu.

256
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,670
It's a piece of Master Zheng's calligraphy.

257
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:46,320
You know I'm a rough person.

258
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:48,960
I don't understand the tastes
of scholars and elites.

259
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,550
So I'd like to invite you

260
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:52,790
to attend the birthday banquet with me

261
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,750
and put in a good word for me
in front of him.

262
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:56,080
And while we're at it, help me elevate

263
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:58,960
the value of Master Zheng's work.

264
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,910
My goodness, such a grand occasion.

265
00:14:00,910 --> 00:14:04,370
I'm just a person of the underworld—
not worthy of being there.

266
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:09,380
Someone from the underworld
saying they're not worthy

267
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:10,840
is like a soldier saying

268
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:12,550
they're scared of blood.

269
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,120
So I advise you

270
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,720
not to decline.

271
00:14:20,630 --> 00:14:21,320
Alright.

272
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:23,390
Since you've put it that way,

273
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,390
I'll...

274
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:25,720
I'll go.

275
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:26,550
Great.

276
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,870
Also,

277
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:32,470
those two people are still useful to me.

278
00:14:32,470 --> 00:14:33,870
Sect Master, could you

279
00:14:34,510 --> 00:14:35,510
make an exception?

280
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:37,970
You're really making this difficult for me.

281
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,910
But since you've asked,

282
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,750
I must give you some face.

283
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,100
How about this?

284
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,000
I'll let one of them go.

285
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:47,280
Who will you choose?

286
00:14:57,510 --> 00:14:58,200
Miss Jiang.

287
00:14:58,670 --> 00:14:59,670
You may leave now.

288
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:01,270
Only one of those two?

289
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:03,050
But I have use for both of them.

290
00:15:03,050 --> 00:15:04,690
Releasing only one makes it hard for me.

291
00:15:04,690 --> 00:15:06,720
You're the one making it hard for me.

292
00:15:06,750 --> 00:15:08,750
I've promised you to let one go.

293
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:09,850
Besides,

294
00:15:10,150 --> 00:15:12,030
I have to take you to Chairman Liu.

295
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,550
I've given you

296
00:15:13,550 --> 00:15:15,320
enough respect and kindness.

297
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:16,510
Shouldn't you

298
00:15:16,510 --> 00:15:17,960
do the same for me?

299
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:20,720
That makes sense.

300
00:15:22,350 --> 00:15:24,280
How about an exchange of hostages?

301
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,860
Who carries that much weight?

302
00:15:30,150 --> 00:15:31,270
Zhang Dancheng.

303
00:15:37,770 --> 00:15:38,530
Mentor.

304
00:15:39,790 --> 00:15:40,840
Why are you back?

305
00:15:42,690 --> 00:15:45,140
How could I not come for such a big matter?

306
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,630
You shouldn't have come back.

307
00:15:46,630 --> 00:15:47,540
Sect Master is in the room.

308
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:48,670
I've talked to Feng Siyuan.

309
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:49,420
He will take me away.

310
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:50,660
Get out of here.

311
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,670
Since I dare to come,

312
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,870
I have a plan.

313
00:16:01,180 --> 00:16:02,300
You taught me.

314
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:06,020
I know exactly what you're thinking.

315
00:16:16,930 --> 00:16:18,080
When I'm gone,

316
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,750
you must remember

317
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,870
how your path forward

318
00:16:22,450 --> 00:16:23,660
should be walked.

319
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:29,890
Zhang Dancheng.

320
00:16:30,550 --> 00:16:32,150
After I kill the Sect Master,

321
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:34,480
I'll come back for your life.

322
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,320
Kid,

323
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:38,560
I'm returning my life

324
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,240
to you.

325
00:16:52,580 --> 00:16:53,820
What a rare guest.

326
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:57,640
It's truly been a while since you've been back.

327
00:17:00,030 --> 00:17:00,790
Something's up?

328
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:01,550
Something's up.

329
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:02,600
What is it?

330
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,089
A life exchange.

331
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:07,720
Tired of living?

332
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:09,240
Have been for a long time.

333
00:17:10,890 --> 00:17:11,930
Deal.

334
00:17:19,819 --> 00:17:21,020
How do you want to die?

335
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,880
I have a choice?

336
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,750
Yes.

337
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:27,109
How about I set up a table of food and wine?

338
00:17:27,109 --> 00:17:28,109
I'll have a drink.

339
00:17:28,230 --> 00:17:29,550
And you have a little too.

340
00:17:29,550 --> 00:17:30,610
Tomorrow morning,

341
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,720
I'll hold a grand funeral for you.

342
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,510
I promise you'll go out in style.

343
00:17:34,510 --> 00:17:35,510
Too much trouble.

344
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:36,830
Not at all.

345
00:17:37,270 --> 00:17:38,480
It's worth it for you.

346
00:17:38,510 --> 00:17:39,670
Just like what I said

347
00:17:39,690 --> 00:17:41,890
when I asked Old Sect Master to save you—

348
00:17:42,210 --> 00:17:43,420
you are a talent.

349
00:17:43,450 --> 00:17:44,690
You flatter me.

350
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:46,130
I'm not that capable.

351
00:17:46,150 --> 00:17:47,960
If I were,

352
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,440
I wouldn't have let Old Sect Master

353
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,160
die in your hands.

354
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:54,090
You still remember this?

355
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:56,740
Old Sect Master
wanted to disband Tianxiang Sect.

356
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:59,260
Where would our hundreds of brothers go?

357
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:01,420
What would be their livelihood?

358
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,070
I had no choice.

359
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:07,680
Every generation brings forth new talents,

360
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:09,070
so I took this position

361
00:18:09,550 --> 00:18:11,280
and became the new Sect Master.

362
00:18:11,550 --> 00:18:13,410
Does Shangguan Hong think so too?

363
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:15,310
I really don't know.

364
00:18:15,790 --> 00:18:17,270
I've been thinking about this
for many years—

365
00:18:17,270 --> 00:18:19,130
and still haven't figured it out.

366
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:20,470
Why don't you tell me?

367
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:23,160
I was blind back then.

368
00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:26,550
I shouldn't have brought her back.

369
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:32,610
[Eight years ago]

370
00:18:48,270 --> 00:18:49,110
Senior.

371
00:18:58,460 --> 00:19:00,060
When did the child pass away?

372
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:02,350
He died of illness.

373
00:19:02,850 --> 00:19:04,580
It hasn't even been half a year.

374
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:07,050
How did you find this place?

375
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,280
Shangguan Chengming...

376
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:12,350
He took your surname?

377
00:19:12,690 --> 00:19:13,440
Yes.

378
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:15,650
I don't want him to know

379
00:19:15,930 --> 00:19:17,460
anything about his father.

380
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:19,630
His father is already the Sect Master.

381
00:19:20,060 --> 00:19:21,520
I thought he died long ago.

382
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:22,940
He got there

383
00:19:22,970 --> 00:19:25,520
by killing the Old Sect Master, Shen Yunhe,

384
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:26,830
to take that position.

385
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:29,290
With him, Tianxiang Sect has changed.

386
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:32,440
The entire sect is an absolute mess.

387
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:34,790
What does it have to do with me?

388
00:19:35,310 --> 00:19:36,570
I want to take you back.

389
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,030
You want to use me

390
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,270
to threaten him?

391
00:19:46,510 --> 00:19:47,440
WIth you around,

392
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:50,480
I can guarantee he steps down

393
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:52,790
without spilling any blood.

394
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,110
This is the best way I can think of.

395
00:19:57,590 --> 00:19:59,250
In the entire Tianxiang Sect,

396
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:02,610
you're the only one who still believes in sentiment.

397
00:20:03,090 --> 00:20:05,170
Now that he's the Sect Master,

398
00:20:05,390 --> 00:20:07,220
how could he, for an old lover,

399
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:08,880
give up his empire?

400
00:20:17,170 --> 00:20:19,830
As long as you can't bring yourself to kill me...

401
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:22,750
I've made up my mind.

402
00:20:24,690 --> 00:20:25,750
I'll take you back.

403
00:20:39,510 --> 00:20:42,230
You used Shangguan Hong
to force me to abdicate

404
00:20:42,360 --> 00:20:45,020
and brought a little swindler
to pretend to be my son.

405
00:20:45,020 --> 00:20:46,910
But what you didn't expect is that

406
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:49,820
my relationship
with Shangguan Hong was over.

407
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,260
That little swindler—

408
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:53,160
you didn't teach him well.

409
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,310
You taught him to be too kind.

410
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,640
I know you already knew

411
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:59,050
he would come back to save me,

412
00:20:59,050 --> 00:21:01,050
which is why you agreed to let him go.

413
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,900
On the road to the underworld,

414
00:21:03,270 --> 00:21:04,730
I'll find you a companion.

415
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:07,610
You're so cruel.

416
00:21:08,310 --> 00:21:09,400
Not as evil as you.

417
00:21:09,830 --> 00:21:10,640
You're too polite.

418
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:12,000
You flatter me.

419
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:15,980
Let me tell you something.

420
00:21:17,370 --> 00:21:20,300
You've actually seen
the real Shangguan Chengming.

421
00:21:32,990 --> 00:21:34,360
From now on,

422
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:37,400
you are my, Jin Buhuan's, disciple.

423
00:22:06,010 --> 00:22:06,860
I'm sorry.

424
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,960
I tried my best to stop him,

425
00:22:10,580 --> 00:22:11,730
but I failed.

426
00:22:15,590 --> 00:22:17,650
Once Mentor decides to do something,

427
00:22:19,270 --> 00:22:20,420
no one can stop him.

428
00:22:21,750 --> 00:22:22,720
Here.

429
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:24,880
What is this?

430
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:27,680
This is the hot syrup
Grandpa Jin taught us to make.

431
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:29,920
Grandpa Jin says hot syrup is better than immortal soup.

432
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:31,180
It's super delicious!

433
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:31,960
Really?

434
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,130
It's delicious.

435
00:22:36,510 --> 00:22:37,200
Thank you.

436
00:22:37,660 --> 00:22:38,660
Go have fun.

437
00:22:42,140 --> 00:22:43,450
Look at these kids.

438
00:22:43,830 --> 00:22:45,350
Without this orphanage,

439
00:22:45,600 --> 00:22:47,680
they might be begging on the streets today,

440
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:50,240
and tomorrow they might be targeting
someone's purse.

441
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:51,440
When they grow up,

442
00:22:52,960 --> 00:22:53,960
will they think that in life

443
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:56,480
there are only two paths: deceive or be deceived?

444
00:22:56,480 --> 00:22:58,540
I helped Mentor set up this orphanage

445
00:22:58,590 --> 00:22:59,480
hoping to

446
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:01,600
give these children a chance

447
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:03,960
a chance to choose a different life.

448
00:23:04,940 --> 00:23:08,370
In the past, your mentor taught you
to strike fast and con slow.

449
00:23:08,370 --> 00:23:09,970
Now that these kids have you,

450
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:13,090
they won't need to learn those things.

451
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:16,780
The right path is always hard to walk.

452
00:23:19,020 --> 00:23:20,590
But I'll keep going.

453
00:23:57,410 --> 00:23:58,170
How did it go?

454
00:23:58,590 --> 00:24:00,110
The information the girls collected

455
00:24:00,110 --> 00:24:01,050
will be ready soon.

456
00:24:01,050 --> 00:24:02,380
Almost 4 boxes of them.

457
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,070
I've prepared the boat tickets

458
00:24:05,070 --> 00:24:06,070
to send them away.

459
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,110
You must

460
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,440
protect them for me.

461
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,170
Don't worry.

462
00:24:09,320 --> 00:24:10,920
I will take good care of them.

463
00:24:11,310 --> 00:24:13,550
I've been preparing
for this day for a long time.

464
00:24:13,550 --> 00:24:14,400
This time,

465
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:15,850
it will succeed.

466
00:24:17,550 --> 00:24:26,150
[Richards Grand Hotel]

467
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:24,860
Chairman Liu gracing us tonight

468
00:24:24,860 --> 00:24:26,720
is my, Siyuan's, greatest honor.

469
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,160
Little Feng,

470
00:24:28,760 --> 00:24:30,310
you handle things very well.

471
00:24:30,310 --> 00:24:30,910
Right now,

472
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:32,790
Yucheng needs talents like you.

473
00:24:32,930 --> 00:24:36,330
I will have to rely heavily on you
in the future, Chairman Liu.

474
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:08,640
Congratulations, Director Feng.

475
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:10,230
You're about to be promoted.

476
00:25:10,230 --> 00:25:11,640
With Chairman Liu's connection,

477
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:12,720
your future career

478
00:25:13,030 --> 00:25:14,360
will surely skyrocket.

479
00:25:14,940 --> 00:25:16,200
Whether it skyrockets

480
00:25:18,740 --> 00:25:20,400
still depends on the Yin Book.

481
00:25:20,870 --> 00:25:22,260
I have only one goal:

482
00:25:23,270 --> 00:25:25,130
to eradicate the Tianxiang Sect.

483
00:25:28,830 --> 00:25:30,490
Sect Master is very cautious.

484
00:25:30,740 --> 00:25:32,880
He won't hide the Yin Book
in Tianxiang Sect.

485
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,060
Go to the Yuzhong River,

486
00:25:34,060 --> 00:25:36,170
under the riverbank of the third stone bridge upstream,

487
00:25:36,170 --> 00:25:37,410
find a hidden post,

488
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:39,980
and you'll be able to get the Yin Book.

489
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:42,860
Don't move!

490
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:44,550
Get out!

491
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:45,350
Yes.

492
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,480
Feng Siyuan.

493
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,920
Your time is coming.

494
00:27:13,320 --> 00:27:15,360
Zhang Dancheng is dead.

495
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:19,640
He stabbed himself to death

496
00:27:22,210 --> 00:27:24,170
just to trade for your life.

497
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:26,280
But I don't understand.

498
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:29,720
Why did you come back

499
00:27:29,750 --> 00:27:31,150
instead of running away?

500
00:27:31,530 --> 00:27:32,860
Later, I figured it out.

501
00:27:34,300 --> 00:27:35,290
Feng Siyuan—

502
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:37,440
he came looking for me time and again.

503
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,240
I guessed that

504
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:39,960
you must be hiding behind him.

505
00:27:40,100 --> 00:27:41,480
Do you think I would be so stupid

506
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:43,000
as to let him raid my sect?

507
00:27:43,910 --> 00:27:44,830
Don't worry.

508
00:27:45,150 --> 00:27:47,080
Everyone has cleared out long ago.

509
00:27:53,040 --> 00:27:55,570
You're pretty good
at pretending to be my son.

510
00:27:56,860 --> 00:27:57,900
Drop the act.

511
00:27:58,510 --> 00:28:00,240
It's just the two of us here now.

512
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:02,810
Haven't you always wanted to kill me?

513
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:04,370
Come on.

514
00:28:05,220 --> 00:28:06,420
I'll grant your wish.

515
00:28:08,660 --> 00:28:09,310
What?

516
00:28:09,750 --> 00:28:11,410
Can't bring yourself to do it?

517
00:28:11,880 --> 00:28:12,680
I know

518
00:28:13,290 --> 00:28:15,850
in your eyes, I'm a bad person.

519
00:28:17,880 --> 00:28:19,510
Then who is a good person?

520
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,090
Old Sect Master?

521
00:28:21,470 --> 00:28:22,600
Was he a good person?

522
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:23,880
Back then,

523
00:28:24,190 --> 00:28:26,610
he used the slogan of overthrowing Qing
and restoring Ming

524
00:28:26,610 --> 00:28:28,800
to make hundreds of brothers starve

525
00:28:28,820 --> 00:28:30,680
while scamming and dying for him.

526
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:32,980
In the end, many ended up dead or injured.

527
00:28:35,670 --> 00:28:37,470
He was a bad guy!

528
00:28:39,950 --> 00:28:40,910
And me?

529
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:44,120
I made sure the brothers ate well,

530
00:28:44,150 --> 00:28:45,700
wore decent clothes,

531
00:28:45,720 --> 00:28:47,440
and looked like respectable men on the streets.

532
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:48,200
When others see them,

533
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:50,030
they even have to greet them with a smile.

534
00:28:50,030 --> 00:28:50,830
It was me!

535
00:28:50,850 --> 00:28:52,170
Who gave them dignity!

536
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:54,470
You gave them dignity?

537
00:28:56,430 --> 00:28:59,290
You clearly made them live worse than pigs and dogs.

538
00:29:01,250 --> 00:29:02,780
You're still too green.

539
00:29:05,740 --> 00:29:07,550
Sometimes I think

540
00:29:07,910 --> 00:29:10,420
you are a bit like me when I was young.

541
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:12,130
You should understand me.

542
00:29:13,110 --> 00:29:14,180
Now it seems

543
00:29:14,630 --> 00:29:16,020
you're still too young.

544
00:29:16,550 --> 00:29:18,250
That's why you've ended up on a dead end.

545
00:29:18,250 --> 00:29:20,110
I'm not the one who's at a dead end,

546
00:29:21,130 --> 00:29:21,960
it's you.

547
00:29:22,230 --> 00:29:22,880
Yes.

548
00:29:22,900 --> 00:29:24,610
Of course you want me to be at a dead end.

549
00:29:24,610 --> 00:29:26,210
So you turned to Feng Siyuan.

550
00:29:26,250 --> 00:29:27,580
Let me tell you

551
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:29,360
what kind of person he is.

552
00:29:29,550 --> 00:29:31,200
When he was a head soldier,

553
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:33,270
he survived by pretending to be dead.

554
00:29:33,710 --> 00:29:34,970
Now you're telling him

555
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,680
I have some Yin Book.

556
00:29:36,700 --> 00:29:38,570
With it, he can become successfull.

557
00:29:38,570 --> 00:29:40,590
You knew he would ask me for it.

558
00:29:40,590 --> 00:29:41,550
If I can't give it to him,

559
00:29:41,550 --> 00:29:42,720
I'll die.

560
00:29:44,030 --> 00:29:45,290
Is that what you think?

561
00:29:52,890 --> 00:29:55,000
But what you don't know is

562
00:29:55,520 --> 00:29:57,720
I really have this Yin Book.

563
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:01,270
And I will cooperate very well

564
00:30:01,270 --> 00:30:02,920
with Feng Siyuan.

565
00:30:03,400 --> 00:30:04,260
What about you?

566
00:30:06,030 --> 00:30:07,310
In his eyes,

567
00:30:07,310 --> 00:30:09,350
you're just an abandoned pawn.

568
00:30:10,170 --> 00:30:11,380
You're useless.

569
00:30:14,700 --> 00:30:16,590
So I advise you

570
00:30:17,090 --> 00:30:18,570
to just go die.

571
00:30:19,710 --> 00:30:21,840
Die far away, don't dirty my turf.

572
00:30:22,110 --> 00:30:23,020
Thanks to you,

573
00:30:23,040 --> 00:30:24,720
Yanzi and Silly Liang

574
00:30:24,970 --> 00:30:26,420
die a quick death too.

575
00:30:30,900 --> 00:30:33,300
Speak of the devil.

576
00:30:50,770 --> 00:30:51,630
Director Feng.

577
00:30:51,670 --> 00:30:53,320
You were tricked by him.

578
00:30:53,480 --> 00:30:54,590
This Yin Book

579
00:30:54,870 --> 00:30:56,020
really exists.

580
00:30:57,050 --> 00:31:00,330
But it's in my brain—
you can't take it away.

581
00:31:00,630 --> 00:31:02,790
But whatever you want to know or ask,

582
00:31:02,810 --> 00:31:04,090
just ask.

583
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:05,710
I will definitely tell you.

584
00:31:07,760 --> 00:31:09,480
As the saying goes,

585
00:31:09,510 --> 00:31:12,440
relying on oneself is better than relying on others.

586
00:31:33,070 --> 00:31:34,030
What is this?

587
00:31:34,090 --> 00:31:34,850
Sect Master.

588
00:31:38,230 --> 00:31:40,230
Why can't you recognize the Yin Book

589
00:31:40,320 --> 00:31:42,120
in front of Director Feng?

590
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:45,570
With this set of Yin Book,

591
00:31:45,810 --> 00:31:47,040
I shan't keep the one

592
00:31:47,840 --> 00:31:48,990
in your mind.

593
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:58,930
You conjured something out of nothing.

594
00:32:05,590 --> 00:32:07,030
Don't worry.

595
00:32:07,450 --> 00:32:08,690
Your retribution

596
00:32:09,720 --> 00:32:10,680
is not over yet.

597
00:32:16,910 --> 00:32:18,150
Good job.

598
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:22,830
I'll go with you.

599
00:32:37,630 --> 00:32:38,740
Your blood debt

600
00:32:40,080 --> 00:32:41,680
must be paid with your blood.

601
00:34:47,080 --> 00:34:48,510
These are people
who have lost their families

602
00:34:48,510 --> 00:34:50,070
because of Tianxiang Sect.

603
00:34:52,550 --> 00:34:53,610
They are here today

604
00:34:53,850 --> 00:34:55,210
to send you off.

605
00:34:58,950 --> 00:34:59,950
How does it feel?

606
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:04,150
It hurts

607
00:35:05,860 --> 00:35:06,780
so darn much.

608
00:35:13,630 --> 00:35:14,800
They hurt more than you.

609
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:16,280
Father!

610
00:35:17,410 --> 00:35:19,810
Father!

611
00:35:19,970 --> 00:35:22,380
Daughter!

612
00:35:24,110 --> 00:35:25,800
Father!

613
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:26,730
Stepmother.

614
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:27,510
Jialiang!

615
00:35:27,880 --> 00:35:28,480
Jiashu!

616
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:29,760
Jialiang!

617
00:35:30,840 --> 00:35:32,110
You caused all of it.

618
00:35:34,510 --> 00:35:35,840
The Tianxiang Sect

619
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:39,690
won't let you get away with this!

620
00:35:44,150 --> 00:35:46,150
There's no Tianxiang Sect anymore.

621
00:35:48,070 --> 00:35:50,000
Don't you know how to tell fortune?

622
00:35:52,000 --> 00:35:54,060
Have a go at how long more you can live.

623
00:35:55,070 --> 00:35:56,360
Buy me a bowl

624
00:35:56,470 --> 00:35:57,280
of wontons.

625
00:36:50,970 --> 00:36:53,010
I am here today

626
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,550
to both expose

627
00:36:54,590 --> 00:36:55,590
and atone.

628
00:36:55,920 --> 00:36:56,840
Tianxiang Sect

629
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:59,000
used to rob the rich and help the poor.

630
00:36:59,230 --> 00:37:00,280
But today,

631
00:37:00,990 --> 00:37:02,320
it's downright filthy.

632
00:37:02,710 --> 00:37:03,950
Extra! Extra!

633
00:37:04,410 --> 00:37:07,230
The biggest fraud organization in Yucheng
has been cracked down!

634
00:37:07,230 --> 00:37:11,560
The Tianxiang Sect uses divination to kill
and scam people out of their money!

635
00:37:13,550 --> 00:37:14,610
What are you doing?

636
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:29,760
Execute!

637
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:33,220
Raise your gun.

638
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:41,590
Good!

639
00:37:42,110 --> 00:37:43,110
Great!

640
00:37:52,040 --> 00:37:53,440
This Liang, seriously.

641
00:37:53,470 --> 00:37:54,550
He ran away

642
00:37:54,850 --> 00:37:56,250
without saying goodbye.

643
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:58,360
He said if we said goodbye
in person,

644
00:37:58,360 --> 00:38:00,290
his wheels might not work anymore.

645
00:38:00,480 --> 00:38:01,410
What does he plan

646
00:38:01,590 --> 00:38:02,650
to do in the future?

647
00:38:02,670 --> 00:38:03,510
He told me

648
00:38:04,030 --> 00:38:05,690
the happiest thing he did
in Tianxiang Sect

649
00:38:05,690 --> 00:38:06,480
is cracking down

650
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,680
on Plum Blossom Sect,

651
00:38:08,280 --> 00:38:09,680
saving so many children.

652
00:38:09,950 --> 00:38:10,870
He plans to

653
00:38:11,150 --> 00:38:12,150
travel around

654
00:38:12,630 --> 00:38:14,160
to teach scammers a lesson.

655
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:17,740
What about you?

656
00:38:18,590 --> 00:38:20,390
What's your plan for the future?

657
00:38:20,630 --> 00:38:22,630
I'll think about it after leaving Yucheng.

658
00:38:22,630 --> 00:38:23,690
Being further away

659
00:38:24,190 --> 00:38:25,190
makes some things

660
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:27,550
become lighter.

661
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,200
You're right.

662
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:30,400
The past

663
00:38:30,550 --> 00:38:31,440
is too heavy.

664
00:38:32,470 --> 00:38:33,670
It's time to let it go.

665
00:38:34,710 --> 00:38:35,590
People

666
00:38:35,900 --> 00:38:37,650
should look forward.

667
00:38:51,480 --> 00:38:53,010
We're going to say goodbye.

668
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,190
Give me a gift.

669
00:38:56,150 --> 00:38:56,920
Sure.

670
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:58,920
What do you want?

671
00:38:59,590 --> 00:39:01,280
I want to know your birthday.

672
00:39:08,710 --> 00:39:09,760
It's today.

673
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:12,450
What a coincidence.

674
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:17,480
I never thought

675
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:18,920
birthday

676
00:39:19,520 --> 00:39:21,520
is something to be happy about.

677
00:39:23,070 --> 00:39:24,550
But from now on,

678
00:39:25,280 --> 00:39:26,630
I can finally

679
00:39:27,490 --> 00:39:29,050
live for myself.

680
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:33,680
Thank you.

681
00:39:37,190 --> 00:39:38,400
I hope

682
00:39:40,320 --> 00:39:41,360
every minute and every second

683
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:43,000
from now on belongs to you,

684
00:39:45,460 --> 00:39:47,260
and that you're happy every day.

685
00:40:00,420 --> 00:40:02,950
♪ Under the old city wall ♪

686
00:40:02,970 --> 00:40:06,520
♪ The rain fell gently that year ♪

687
00:40:07,390 --> 00:40:13,350
♪ You walked by with an umbrella,
saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

688
00:40:11,250 --> 00:40:12,600
Happy birthday.

689
00:40:14,410 --> 00:40:16,710
♪ In the future, the blades ♪

690
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,650
From now on,

691
00:40:16,760 --> 00:40:18,400
every minute and every second

692
00:40:17,510 --> 00:40:21,110
♪ Are all hidden in smiles ♪

693
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:20,440
all belong to us.

694
00:40:22,170 --> 00:40:29,420
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark
cut deep into my heart ♪

695
00:40:29,640 --> 00:40:32,240
♪ You fully know ♪

696
00:40:32,640 --> 00:40:35,630
♪ How weak I am ♪

697
00:40:35,980 --> 00:40:44,090
♪ Yet you always turn around, shielding me
from harsh words and cold daggers ♪

698
00:40:44,950 --> 00:40:48,410
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

699
00:40:48,430 --> 00:40:51,340
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

700
00:40:51,980 --> 00:40:55,490
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

701
00:40:55,520 --> 00:40:58,090
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

702
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:02,540
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

703
00:41:02,570 --> 00:41:05,260
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

704
00:41:05,980 --> 00:41:09,370
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

705
00:41:09,570 --> 00:41:14,480
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

706
00:41:37,580 --> 00:41:40,990
[Six months later]

707
00:41:58,840 --> 00:41:59,510
Jiaxian,

708
00:41:59,710 --> 00:42:00,640
a letter for you.

709
00:42:02,590 --> 00:42:03,280
Thanks.

710
00:42:03,300 --> 00:42:04,220
Bye.

711
00:42:04,600 --> 00:42:06,290
[To Wang Jiaxian]

712
00:42:18,030 --> 00:42:19,030
Jiaxian,

713
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:20,280
how have you been?

714
00:42:20,670 --> 00:42:21,840
I now have a disciple,

715
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:24,100
and I had him
to write this letter for you.

716
00:42:24,480 --> 00:42:25,800
In Yucheng,

717
00:42:25,800 --> 00:42:27,460
I felt suffocated in my chest.

718
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:30,440
I've been able to breathe well
since I came out.

719
00:42:30,880 --> 00:42:32,550
The Chrysler you gave me—

720
00:42:32,670 --> 00:42:34,320
it's truly a gas guzzler.

721
00:42:34,480 --> 00:42:35,940
I can't drive it that much.

722
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:38,670
If you have time, shall we meet?

723
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:40,320
Bring Feiyan too.

724
00:42:40,550 --> 00:42:41,760
The three of us

725
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:44,220
and try doing something together again.

726
00:42:44,510 --> 00:42:46,150
I hope all is well with you

727
00:42:46,440 --> 00:42:47,840
and things are peaceful.

728
00:42:48,770 --> 00:42:49,900
Missing you, Liang.

729
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:55,920
Wang Jiaxian.

730
00:42:58,670 --> 00:42:59,510
Sir,

731
00:43:00,070 --> 00:43:00,920
you know me?

732
00:43:01,840 --> 00:43:02,570
My name is...

733
00:43:03,040 --> 00:43:04,340
Shangguan Chengming.
